   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 2: Fix the Program</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">A syntax error stops the program. How do you know when you have fixed one?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>The program runs. For a logic error, it must also give the right answer.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Each program has one error. It is already in the box. Find the error, fix it, then press Run and check.</p><div id=\"y9l26-activity-2\"></div>"
